  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Slice apple into thin wedges.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-cdb5fc9b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-38715b9c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large bowl, combine the plain flour and Aussie spice blend. Season, then add haloumi slices, turning to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-927705e2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook apple, stirring regularly, until softened, 3-5 minutes. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Add the honey and cook, stirring, until reduced and sticky, 2-3 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-b7d8d339.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.\n• Meanwhile, to the bowl with the apple, add mixed salad leaves, tomatoes, croutons and mustard cider dressing. Toss to combine, then season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-d1195ced.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide caramelised apple salad with croutons between bowls. Top with haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e65a80e68b9aa9f0b6168/step-2f03252b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
